# Fluid property tables for the gas models.
#
# All four files are generated and redistributable. They are built by the tools in
# scripts/fluidprop, which record their own provenance in each file header:
#
#   thermo.inp     NASA-9 records for the species in species.txt, extracted from the
#                  NASA CEA database with a generated low temperature interval merged
#                  into each record where one could be fitted
#   trans.inp      the matching transport polynomials
#   gasdata.inp    critical constants and dipole moments, per record sources
#   cubicalpha.inp alpha function parameters for the species the reader can reach
#
# Nothing here is excluded. This file exists to say so, since an empty ignore file
# in a data directory usually means the opposite.
